*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% A trimmed copy of the driver file macOS built for a printer that sent a
*% broken language code: no paper list, so Letter only.
*% PPD created by ipp2ppd (v3:Feb 12 2022)
*NickName: "Example-AirPrint"
*% WARNING no printer-strings for the language "en"
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*APAirPrint: True
*APPrinterIconPath: "/Library/Printers/Icons/EXAMPLE.icns"
*% WARNING there are no paper sizes. Generating letter as a placeholder.
*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*DefaultDuplex: DuplexNoTumble
*APScannerUUID: "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
*APICADriver: True
*APScannerModulePath: "/Library/Image Capture/Devices/Example Scanner.app"
